>   by a cockatrice corpse after I kill it and all I can see is an item.  If you
>   kill a monster and he was carrying something will it ALWAYS display the
>   corpse on top?

Eating some corpses that are poisonous (make sure that you're poison
resistant first though or suffer the consequences!) will prevent you
from turning to stone...or lizard corpses...

Cockatrice corpses won't turn you to stone unless you attempt to pick
them up without some gloves on...so beware! As such, you can stand on
them and sort through the items that you want...

Oh...and the corpses also make _great_ weapons...if you can hold
them...
hehehehe...

>   Also, if I levitate over said corpse it can't hurt me yes?

